<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>DTP LinkedIn Card — AI Foundry</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="card foundry">
      <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <section class="content">
        <p class="kicker">digitaltechnologypartner.ai/ai-foundry</p>
        <h1>An AI Foundry is not a lab for clever demos.</h1>
        <p class="body">It is a controlled route from messy business opportunity to tested working proof: intake, challenge, evidence, build, decision. Without that route, the Foundry becomes a theatre with a backlog.</p>
        <div class="proof route" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>intake</span><i></i><span>challenge</span><i></i><span>prove</span><i></i><span>decide</span>
        </div>
        <footer class="footer-row">
          <div class="cta">Book a Discovery Call</div>
          <img class="logo" src="/images/DTP logo - White-2.png" alt="Digital Technology Partner" width="54" height="54" />
        </footer>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  @font-face { font-family: 'Inter Tight Local'; src: local('Inter Tight'), local('Inter'); }
  :root { --bg: #050507; --mint: #05CC90; --white: #EBEBEB; --muted: #BFC3CA; --panel: #121222; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; width: 100%; min-height: 100%; background: var(--bg); }
  body { font-family: Inter, 'Inter Tight Local', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: var(--white); }
  .card { width: 1080px; height: 1350px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #050507; isolation: isolate; }
  .card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse 760px 700px at 82% 30%, rgba(5,204,144,.11), transparent 62%), radial-gradient(ellipse 520px 520px at 16% 82%, rgba(42,64,220,.075), transparent 64%); z-index: -2; }
  .card::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.035) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.026) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 72px 72px; mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 38% 45%, black 0%, rgba(0,0,0,.45) 70%, transparent 100%); opacity: .82; z-index: -1; }
  .grain { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.026), transparent 18%, rgba(5,204,144,.025) 100%); pointer-events: none; }
  .content { position: relative; height: 100%; padding: 104px 92px 92px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; }
  .kicker { margin: 0 0 52px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--mint); letter-spacing: .035em; }
  h1 { margin: 0; max-width: 860px; font-size: 112px; line-height: .91; letter-spacing: -.066em; font-weight: 850; color: var(--white); }
  .body { max-width: 820px; margin: 54px 0 0; color: rgba(235,235,235,.78); font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.45; letter-spacing: -.018em; }
  .proof { margin-top: 56px; max-width: 820px; padding: 25px 27px; border: 1px solid rgba(5,204,144,.25); border-radius: 24px; background: rgba(18,18,34,.74); box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.25); }
  .route { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto; gap: 18px; align-items: center; }
  .route span { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .075em; color: rgba(235,235,235,.78); }
  .route span:first-child { color: var(--mint); }
  .route i { height: 1px; min-width: 32px; background: rgba(5,204,144,.44); display: block; }
  .footer-row { margin-top: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; max-width: 820px; }
  .cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 78px; padding: 0 36px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--mint); color: #050507; font-size: 25px; font-weight: 760; letter-spacing: -.02em; box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(5,204,144,.18); }
  .logo { width: 54px; height: 54px; max-width: 54px; object-fit: contain; opacity: .94; flex: 0 0 54px; }
</style>
